{"items":[{"id":"1330159454369845248","title":"再说句政治很不正确的话吧","content":"<p>再说句政治很不正确的话吧。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我认为知乎上市后再怎么估值市值也赶不上拼多多昨天一晚上的表现。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;.........</p>","excerpt":"再说句政治很不正确的话吧","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":9,"created":1609914727,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1330159454369845248"},{"id":"1330002469661511680","title":"资本还真就不讲武德...","content":"<p>资本还真就不讲武德...</p>","excerpt":"资本还真就不讲武德...","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":17,"created":1609877299,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1330002469661511680"},{"id":"1329935808049070080","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-ebeafe84f804e6bb4966f8fea7782668_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"1137\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":8,"created":1609861405,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1329935808049070080"},{"id":"1329779241119617024","title":"恒大多地商铺“0元购”：按每年10%分10年…","content":"<p>恒大多地商铺“0元购”：按每年10%分10年返还购房款。&lt;br&gt;1月5日，网上出现了多张恒大集团商铺0元购的海报，称“0元抢商铺，预期收益每年10%，十年回本。”&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;要商铺真能这么好.....还需要这些嘛....&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;人养铺三年，铺养人一生？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;一铺坑一生差不多吧...</p>","excerpt":"恒大多地商铺“0元购”：按每年10%分10年…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":8,"created":1609824077,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1329779241119617024"},{"id":"1329395511787110400","title":"关于拼多多吧.... 大家可以看看上一个频…","content":"<p>关于拼多多吧....&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;大家可以看看上一个频繁传出跳楼事件的宁波银行在资本市场的走势就明白资本市场对拼多多的态度了。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;再换个角度来说，从现在传出的多多买菜全年无休现状来看，对社区团购的限制像不像一个笑话？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;再想深一层.....&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;阿里、京东、滴滴、美团在这个赛道能拼得过拼多多嘛？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;谁会是最后的赢家呢？</p><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-945327018aeb55de9b0aa6e4ad515e29_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"748\" height=\"892\">","excerpt":"关于拼多多吧.... 大家可以看看上一个频…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":18,"created":1609732588,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1329395511787110400"},{"id":"1329178282114433024","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-fd5391400c6d6b24879261c421e22467_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"744\" height=\"856\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":26,"created":1609680797,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1329178282114433024"},{"id":"1328757309577850880","title":"我缺的是那5000块嘛？","content":"<p>我缺的是那5000块嘛？</p><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-bef7c46449dec1b7faaa422e7bcb473c_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"551\">","excerpt":"我缺的是那5000块嘛？","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":16,"created":1609580429,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1328757309577850880"},{"id":"1327993401535311872","title":"啥叫专业？","content":"<p>啥叫专业？</p><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-6e68e2ee3a0f33d51369cc5ac0d48d5f_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"825\" height=\"364\">","excerpt":"啥叫专业？","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":17,"created":1609398299,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1327993401535311872"},{"id":"1327969367482101760","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-473d9699a74d7eba324084e3d0483b27_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"487\" height=\"800\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":17,"created":1609392569,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1327969367482101760"},{"id":"1327695606748626944","title":"在打击非法集资过程中，要努力通过多种方…","content":"<p>在打击非法集资过程中，要努力通过多种方式让人民群众认识到：&lt;br&gt;高收益意味着高风险。&lt;br&gt;收益率超过6%的就要打问号，超过8%的就很危险，10%以上就要准备损失全部本金。</p><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-764efb6f668f5bfa53005b842bf1f9bb_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1155\">","excerpt":"在打击非法集资过程中，要努力通过多种方…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":14,"created":1609327300,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1327695606748626944"}]}